# Extra SITL parameters for run_sitl.sh, after Tools/autotest/default_params/copter.parm.
# SITL's default 3.3 Ah pack draws about 25 A in the + model, so one copter reaches the
# low-battery rule (spec 08 §4, BATTERY_LOW) and lands for a swap after about 350 s.
# A 20 Ah pack keeps the whole of task set 1 on one battery, like the 50 Wh Mavic model.
BATT_CAPACITY 20000
